{"id":19282,"title":"From the Border, She Claims Her VENGEANCES","slug":"from-the-border-she-claims-her-vengeances","platform":"other","episodes":60,"cover":"https://dramadog.app/c/19282.webp","description":"Agnès, a French aristocrat, travels to the United States to build a business while concealing her true identity. She falls victim to a scheme orchestrated by her husband, Thomas, and his mistress, Isabelle—a plot to defraud her of her fortune—culminating in her abduction and abandonment along the Mexican border. Having narrowly escaped death, she returns to high society as the eldest daughter of the prestigious Gramont family. With calculated precision, she unravels the illicit web of interests woven by the pair; through a high-stakes battle of commerce and human psychology, she exacts her revenge, reclaiming everything that was stolen from her and forcing Thomas and Isabelle to pay a devastating price.","about":"From the Border, She Claims Her VENGEANCES is an English short drama in 60 episodes, originally released on Other apps in October 2026. It falls under Mystery & Thriller, Cheating & Betrayal, Hidden Identity and Revenge. Every episode is free to watch on DramaDog, with no app or sign-up.","genres":["Mystery & Thriller","Cheating & Betrayal","Hidden Identity","Revenge"],"rating":null,"releaseDate":"2026-10-19","epsChunk":1},
{"id":19280,"title":"Hunting Aspen: Blizzard Escape","slug":"hunting-aspen-blizzard-escape","platform":"other","episodes":60,"cover":"https://dramadog.app/c/19280.webp","description":"Chloe, heiress to a top medical conglomerate, suffers three years of chronic poisoning at the hands of her husband Arthur and his personal assistant Lisa. She is disfigured, forced into the role of a \"mental patient,\" and faces having her stem cells harvested alive to save their illegitimate child. Arthur lures Chloe to a snowy Aspen cabin, planning to force her to sign a share transfer, harvest her stem cells alive, and throw her body off a cliff to fake a suicide. A stomach spasm makes Chloe vomit the poison and unexpectedly wake up; she overhears the entire plot and is shocked to discover that her father's car accident was also caused by Arthur to seize power. Hunted and with the poison taking effect, she escapes barefoot into a minus-twenty-degree blizzard and begins her fight for survival. On the brink of death, she meets Victor, chairman of a hundred-billion-dollar Wall Street conglomerate. Using the half of a broken silver coin Chloe dropped, Victor recognizes her as the orphanage sister he has searched for twenty years! To protect Chloe, the two join forces for a desperate counterattack; they see through Daniel's scheme and publicly expose Arthur and Lisa's crimes before everyone, and the two are ultimately imprisoned. Chloe personally reclaims control of VEX Group and, under Victor's doting protection, returns to the pinnacle of power, completing her ultimate revenge.","about":"Hunting Aspen: Blizzard Escape is an English short drama in 60 episodes, originally released on Other apps in October 2026. It falls under Doctor & Medical, Heir & Heiress, Billionaire & CEO and Revenge. Every episode is free to watch on DramaDog, with no app or sign-up.","genres":["Doctor & Medical","Heir & Heiress","Billionaire & CEO","Revenge"],"rating":null,"releaseDate":"2026-10-19","epsChunk":1}