{"id":15324,"title":"Scandal! I'm Pregnant & Naming the CEO","slug":"scandal-im-pregnant-naming-the-ceo","platform":"yourchannel","episodes":12,"cover":"https://dramadog.app/c/15324.webp","description":"Daisy Smith works as a salesperson at a luxury boutique. Due to her family's preference for sons over daughters, she has been exploited financially and emotionally by her three younger brothers. One day, while delivering a handbag, she is drugged by a client, Alex Charles, but is rescued by his son, Aron Charles, resulting in an unexpected romantic encounter. Aron Charles, the CEO of LM group, initially mistakes Daisy for a gold-digger but gradually becomes drawn to her stubborn independence. He frequently creates opportunities to see her by bringing his sisters to buy handbags. Daisy is later framed by a colleague, falsely accused of seducing a client, and exposed as being pregnant. In a moment of desperation, she claims that Aron is the child's father, causing a scandal. After moving from misunderstanding to discovering the truth, Aron stands by Daisy, exposing the villains' schemes. Together, they confront Aron's mother's \"gold-digger test\" and Daisy's parasitic family, ultimately breaking through societal prejudices. Daisy transforms into a strong, independent woman, while Aron escapes the constraints of his arranged family marriage. Blending real-world struggles and romantic satisfaction, their story unfolds as a mutual redemption between Cinderella and a domineering CEO.","about":"Scandal! I'm Pregnant & Naming the CEO is an English short drama in 12 episodes, originally released on YourChannel in June 2026. It falls under Mystery & Thriller, Secret Baby & Pregnancy, Family Drama and Billionaire & CEO. Viewers on YourChannel rate it 8.7 out of 10. Every episode is free to watch on DramaDog, with no app or sign-up.","genres":["Mystery & Thriller","Secret Baby & Pregnancy","Family Drama","Billionaire & CEO"],"rating":8.7,"releaseDate":"2026-06-26","epsChunk":5}